ages/033/723/999/large/jesse-sandifer-manon-fr-earlylook.jpg?1610404336\n\nhttps://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/033/724/002/4k/jesse-sandifer-manon-fr-finalheadturns.jpg?1610568784\n\nシチュエーション\nこのシーンを参照\n\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/medalofhonor/images/7/7e/Manon_Crete.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210614121409\n \n1943年、クレタ島で潜入記者に変装していた彼女は、ナチスの兵士に捕まり、尋問される。尋問の間、彼女は何度もレイプされ、慈悲を乞う。\n\nポーズはお任せしますが、彼女の表情は絶叫／怒りのアヘ顔でお願いします。\n\nありがとうございました。\n宜しくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@L_S_D_/works/305", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aff34e7a/uploads/origins/ed264557-c907-482f-8a02-a9853cc8336b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cca0911f2d259b2293b762da6391e86a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aff34e7a/uploads/origins/ed264557-c907-482f-8a02-a9853cc8336b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cca0911f2d259b2293b762da6391e86a, https://si.imgix.net/aff34e7a/uploads/origins/ed264557-c907-482f-8a02-a9853cc8336b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0b8d29cb35c32451aca74f3688e3dc67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aff34e7a/uploads/origins/ed264557-c907-482f-8a02-a9853cc8336b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3d9e1aeeeb9d52cd4319572b31c8277c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@L_S_D_/works/304", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5025017d/uploads/origins/ea853c71-e355-4f99-8067-5968f3bc1cd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=